# Project names dropped into a script: an input action (Preview > Script
# chips: is_action_pressed, Shift: is_action_down), an asset with Alt (a
# sound: Audio.play_sound), an animation (Animation tab's hand:
# animation_play on that player).
wait 5
click @menu:View
click @menu:View/Workspaces
click @menu:Workspaces/Animation
wait 3
key escape
click @asset:scripts/player_ship.lua
dblclick @asset:scripts/player_ship.lua
wait 5
key ctrl+g
type 17
key enter
key enter
key up
drag @preview.action:jump @code.caret
expect code.text contains Input.is_action_pressed("jump")
key end
key enter
hold shift
drag @preview.action:interact @code.caret
release
expect code.text contains Input.is_action_down("interact")
key end
key enter
hold alt
drag @asset:audio/cannon-gunshot-1.wav @code.caret
release
expect code.text contains Audio.play_sound("audio/cannon-gunshot-1.wav")
screenshot dropped
key end
key enter
click @hier:PlayerShip
key ctrl+a
type animation player
key enter
wait 3
click @anim.new
drag @anim.drag @code.caret
expect code.text contains :animation_play("anim_1")
